flowchart TB
    classDef edge fill:#e0f0ff,stroke:#2471a3,color:#000
    classDef hot fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c0392b,color:#000
    classDef infra fill:#f2f2f2,stroke:#555,color:#000

    Client([Global client])
    Geo[GeoDNS or anycast routes to the nearest region]:::edge

    subgraph R1[Region us-east-2]
        GW1[API Gateway plus rate limit middleware]:::hot
        Redis1[(Redis cluster local counters only)]:::hot
        BE1[Backend Service]
    end

    subgraph R2[Region eu-central-1]
        GW2[API Gateway plus rate limit middleware]:::hot
        Redis2[(Redis cluster local counters only)]:::hot
        BE2[Backend Service]
    end

    Control[Slow async rebalancer runs every few seconds optional]:::infra

    Client --> Geo
    Geo -->|nearest hop for this request| GW1
    Geo -->|nearest hop for this request| GW2
    GW1 -->|atomic check and increment local only no cross region call| Redis1
    GW2 -->|atomic check and increment local only no cross region call| Redis2
    GW1 -->|allowed| BE1
    GW2 -->|allowed| BE2

    Redis1 -.reports regional usage every few seconds.-> Control
    Redis2 -.reports regional usage every few seconds.-> Control
    Control -.adjusts each region's local limit share.-> Redis1
    Control -.adjusts each region's local limit share.-> Redis2
